      "decision": "considered",
      "rationale": "Read the card and pinned benchmark forward: action-derived multi_masks initialize sequence hubs. This reinforces that retaining masks leaves feedback information after token-channel interventions. Prior declared use was provenance only; prior local token-loss results neither validate INFNet nor a hub mechanism.",
